    intro: "The first book of the Bible tells of God's creation of the world and his relationship with the first couple. The word 'covenant' does not appear in Genesis 1 and 2, yet the pattern is covenant-like: a Creator who gives gifts, a command to obey, a warning and a tree of life. Christians have understood this relationship in slightly different ways.",
